                                            "The lid of the Ark of the Covenant, on which God is said to have been enthroned; taken to represent the throne in heaven."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Judaism"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65b75cae-e57c-45a3-b88a-5a791e1facc9",
                                                "sense_id": "1683cd40-1425-38dd-a6bc-607ae1ecacb9",
                                                "text": "And thou shalt make a Mercieseat of pure gold: two cubites and a halfe shalbe the length thereof, and a cubite and a halfe the breadth thereof."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "555fdca8-7ea2-4389-acd9-73aacb83a616",
                                                "sense_id": "1683cd40-1425-38dd-a6bc-607ae1ecacb9",
                                                "text": "The greatest mystery of Religion is expressed by adumbration, and in the noblest part of Jewish Types, we finde the Cherubims shadowing the Mercy-seat."
                                            }
